# CCH Price Capture Tool — workspace scope

This folder is **`flowgear-sample-app`** — the **CCH Price Capture Tool** (`ReceiptConfirmationApp`).

- Do **not** edit, run, or open **`flowgear-support-dashboard`** (Support Dashboard) unless the user explicitly asks.
- Sibling apps under `C:\Projects\CCH FlowGear App\` share the same Flowgear tenant/site but are separate codebases.
- Local dev for this app uses **`FG_DEV_PORT=3001`** in `.env.local` (Support Dashboard uses 3000).
- Orders list API: **GET `/v2/ReceiptNoPrice`** — not SupportIntegrationList.
